# Nothing here is generated - the app is served as it sits. This file exists to keep out the two
# things that would otherwise creep in and matter: an .env holding a key, in a repo that is public on
# purpose because the only key in it is the publishable one, and an installed tool's folder.

node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!*.env.example

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
